WEBVTT

00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:07.162
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：…Where is this? So many lights, like stars.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:16.147
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：My lord, the air is cold… yet something smells good.

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:19.000
<v You>You：Cold, isn't it? Let's go in!

00:00:21.200 --> 00:00:28.083
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：So this is a tavern of the new age. Small, but full of life!

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:34.278
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Golden sake pouring from a barrel! What is this foam!?

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.600
<v You>You：Cheers!

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.850
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Cheers!

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.050
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Cheers!

00:00:36.400 --> 00:00:39.292
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：…Cold! But delicious!

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:40.588
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Ha ha ha!

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.492
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Charcoal-grilled. Eat it while it's hot.

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:48.400
<v You>You：Let's eat!

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:55.926
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：My lord has a cat's tongue — let's blow on it for him.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.660
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：I can hear you, Ieyasu!

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:06.874
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：And what's this? The ice is singing… fizzing.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:10.178
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：So refreshing my throat could freeze!

00:01:10.800 --> 00:01:18.617
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Hot sake for me… ah, it warms me to the core.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:24.462
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Ieyasu — still cautious after four hundred years.

00:01:24.400 --> 00:01:27.000
<v You>You：Open the window and you can see the Kamo River.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:36.051
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：The lights of Kyoto on the river… so this is what the realm became.

00:01:36.600 --> 00:01:41.467
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：No one carries a sword… It is a good age.

00:01:41.800 --> 00:01:45.000
<v You>You：…Yes. It's a very peaceful age.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:50.200
<v You>You：One last toast, with a highball!

00:01:50.200 --> 00:01:52.271
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：To the future!

00:01:52.200 --> 00:01:54.925
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：To the future!

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.588
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Ha ha ha!

00:01:55.600 --> 00:01:56.950
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：Ho ho ho.

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:05.684
<v Ieyasu>Ieyasu：It was a joyful night. Call us again.

00:02:06.000 --> 00:02:11.334
<v Nobunaga>Nobunaga：Next time, take us to where good sake is born!

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:15.000
<v You>You：Yes! I promise.
